muew-preset 2
name Velvet Texture
category Pad
author MUEW Factory
tags pad dark warm soft
desc Dark noise table under a warm triangle; TILT -6 keeps it velvet-soft.
osc1Shape 5
osc2Shape 1
osc2Detune 0
osc2Level 0.5
filterCutoff 2600
filterReso 0.3
filterMode 0
amp 1.4 1 0.9 2.8
mod 0.01 0.3 0 0.2
lfo1Rate 0.2
lfo1Shape 1
lfo2 0.35 1
warp1 0 0
warp2 0 0
mseg 1 0 4 0 0 0.15 1 0.55 -0.3 1 0
unison 3 1 0.12 0 0.7 0.7
lfo34 0.07 1 0.11 0
wtpos 0.4 0
trim -2
wtgen1 noise 333 24 0.35 0.08
wtspec1 0 0 -6 0
routes 9
route 9 11 0.4
route 5 2 3
route 6 5 0.7
route 6 6 0.7
route 7 4 4
route 8 1 0.3
route 8 3 0.25
route 8 7 0.4
route 8 8 0.4
chorus 0 0.6 6 15 0.35
delay 0 0.28 0.42 0.35 0.22
reverb 1 0.8 0.4 0.3
